    [*Panama Shipping Canal*], [Colon to Panama City], [72 km; lock system with Gatun Lake; opened 1914; cuts 13,000 km NY-SF voyage.],
    [*Big Inch Petroleum Pipeline*], [Gulf of Mexico to New Jersey], [24-inch diameter; carries crude petroleum to North-East US industrial refineries.],
